###  http://example.invalid/ontologies/amino-acid/2006/05/18/amino-acid.owl#AliphaticAminoAcid
<http://example.invalid/ontologies/amino-acid/2006/05/18/amino-acid.owl#AliphaticAminoAcid> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                                            owl:equivalentClass [ owl:intersectionOf ( <http://example.invalid/ontologies/amino-acid/2006/05/18/amino-acid.owl#AminoAcid>
                                                                                                                                       [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
